OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBeginning
OL,6,Fdry with clear spells this evening,
OL,7,Fbut becoming cloudier overnight as a
OL,8,Fband of rain, heavy at times, moves
OL,9,Facross the region from midnight. Winds
OL,10,Fwill gradually ease through the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA mild and wet start, skies
OL,13,Fslowly clearing from the north from
OL,14,Flate morning. Chance of some showers
OL,15,Fdeveloping during the afternoon and
OL,16,Fmore frequent along the Norfolk coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
